      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is another issue and might not fix in this CL. This function doesn\u0027t work well because this hook is called *BEFORE* chipset is force-shutdown. That means the EC would enter hibernate mode before the AP is force off. The AP is still running but the EC has slept. :-(\n\nI think we can remove this function and let prevent_deep_discharge() to hibernate EC.",
